          "kicker": "Funding shortage",
          "heading": "Fiji Deaf Rugby 7s teams seek $70,000 funding for World Championship",
          "body": "The Fiji deaf rugby sevens squad requires between $50,000 and $70,000 in additional funding to complete their campaign at the World Deaf Rugby Sevens Championship in Tokyo. Team manager Lionel Danford confirmed that despite kit support from the Australian High Commission’s PacificAus Sports programme, a funding gap remains for daily expenses and camp preparations. Both the men's and women's teams have entered camp ahead of the tournament."
