          "kicker": "Selection claim",
          "heading": "Ollie Sleightholme stakes England claim with hat-trick in high-scoring Northampton win",
          "body": "Ollie Sleightholme put himself back into contention for November’s Tests with a standout hat-trick during Northampton’s 71-48 victory over Bath. The winger beat 11 defenders and recorded four linebreaks at Franklin’s Gardens, rediscovering the form that previously earned him a place in the senior international setup. Second-row Alex Coles and fly-half Fin Smith also impressed Steve Borthwick by scoring in the 119-point shootout, which was the second-highest scoring fixture in Premiership history."
        },
