          "heading": "Italy maintains high-water mark for best-ever international world ranking position",
          "body": "Italy currently holds its best-ever world ranking of No. 8, a position the nation originally reached in 2007 and matched in 2024. As the squad prepares to face South Africa, they look to improve upon their current standing in the Nations Championship. Italy sits 11th on the log with 37 points scored and 131 points conceded across their opening 3 fixtures of the tournament."
