          "kicker": "International eligibility",
          "heading": "Hector Patterson faces international future decision amid English and French interest",
          "body": "Reported earlier this month, Edinburgh scrum-half Hector Patterson is weighing his future as leading clubs in England and France monitor his status. While Patterson has progressed through the Scottish age-grade system, representing the side at U18 and U20 levels, his eligibility through a grandparent leaves his senior international future open to England. Currently contracted with Edinburgh until the end of the season, the 21-year-old remains a key prospect for national selectors ahead of the 2027 Rugby World Cup cycle."
        },
