          "heading": "Aaron Wainwright stars as Leicester Tigers secure victory against Gloucester",
          "body": "Wales international Aaron Wainwright played a pivotal role in Leicester Tigers’ 38-31 win over Gloucester at Welford Road, marking his first try for the club. Wainwright, who was described by outlets as having been up since 3am, bolstered his standout performance with 14 completed tackles. This victory served as a significant kick-start for Leicester’s season, helping them retain the Slater Cup while contributing to an outstanding team performance under the floodlights in front of the Duke of Sussex."
