          "kicker": "Coaching appointment",
          "heading": "Shaun Edwards finalises Argentina deal ahead of autumn Nations Championship series",
          "body": "Following confirmation of his backroom reshuffle, head coach Felipe Contepomi has secured Shaun Edwards to oversee the national side’s defensive structures. Edwards will complete his current consultancy with the Red Roses before joining Los Pumas at the end of October. Contepomi noted the new additions bring \"enormous international experience\" as the squad prepares for upcoming matches against Ireland, Italy, and France. This appointment, alongside Mario Ledesma’s return as forwards coach, is contracted to run until the 2027 World Cup."
        },
