      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Bledisloe Cup",
          "heading": "Les Kiss backs Australia to return fire in Sydney Bledisloe rematch",
          "body": "Wallabies head coach Les Kiss has moved to rally his squad following Saturday’s 50-19 defeat at Eden Park, tasking his players with a rigorous review ahead of next week’s return fixture in Sydney. The loss marked the first defeat of the Kiss era, snapping a five-match unbeaten run. “We’ll work hard on what we have to do,” Kiss said. “We’ll go back and we’ll work on what we have to and try and turn the dial in the right areas.”"
        },
        {
